  "evidence": "Original producer/consumer and message-bound reconstruction.352EA..354D4 updates app838 selected tractor target; lock messages2/3, movement/immovable messages6/7 and source37894 WORD95 bind the role.357AA copies released target to83C; reuse requires same target plus a nearby type95 marker.836 is command-negation phase, not a reliable lock boolean.84C adds to target heading and decays by4 with original0/-4 oscillation;84E is ASR attraction shift adjusted0..10.850 is a conditional modulo16 velocity-halving phase, not universal frames.848 stores scaled model lower-Y extent for marker positioning on planets.353F8 sets AA2 input override, release paths clear; preserve original stale/gated behavior rather than asserting target validity.Collect3574C setsA9F andAA0=10; type95 updates share this countdown while increasing scale shift until retirement. These markers follow the selected target with one-eighth deltas and are cleared on the distant path; directory entry95 merely says No records found, so role comes from actual producer/consumer, not guessed appearance.7ED is transient AI selection:9766/9784 chooses type12 versus25 projectile; scheduler masks and outer-loop clear define its scratch lifetime. AF90 loads the player into A4 then falls through existing stored-XZ heading body.6D8 records player contact type from A2 and specific structure constants;7CE/7CF gate collision response for original3/4 update steps, including IRQ reversal and speed clear at1. No all-type object field, inventory capacity, all-path ownership, hardware timing, arbitrary-input safety or new runtime encounter is inferred. Original code and control rules retained.",
  "semantic_limits": [
    "Contact type is cleared each contact pass and can be seeded with synthetic type66 from geometry contact; it is not an unqualified identity of the last world record",
    "Tractor key continuation retains original CCR assumptions, including BEQ after MOVEA; names do not establish null safety",
    "Type95 role comes from the constructor, target-follow/shrink consumer and Tractor Beam Locked text; stored name is No records found, not visual-model recognition",
    "No new successful tractor/AI/contact runtime encounter is claimed; this batch is statically reconstructed",
    "The three collision-response counts are update steps, not certified physical frames"
  ],
